The program ended.

281
00:09:57,885 --> 00:10:00,024
The sabotage, one senator later wrote,

282
00:10:00,044 --> 00:10:00,592
continued.

283
00:10:01,163 --> 00:10:03,494
In November 1975, the Senate's Church

284
00:10:03,514 --> 00:10:06,100
Committee pulled the story into the open.

285
00:10:06,570 --> 00:10:09,503
It found concrete evidence of at least

286
00:10:09,523 --> 00:10:11,989
eight plots involving the CIA to

287
00:10:12,009 --> 00:10:14,942
assassinate Fidel Castro, from 1960 to

288
00:10:14,962 --> 00:10:15,331
