289
00:10:15,901 --> 00:10:17,793
Those plots, it said, could not be

290
00:10:17,813 --> 00:10:19,987
understood without the fully authorized

291
00:10:20,007 --> 00:10:21,844
assaults on his regime, including

292
00:10:21,864 --> 00:10:22,913
Operation Mongoose.

293
00:10:23,482 --> 00:10:25,512
But the committee could not find that any

294
00:10:25,532 --> 00:10:27,262
