295
00:10:27,732 --> 00:10:29,883
The system, it wrote, was so ambiguous

296
00:10:29,903 --> 00:10:32,282
that it is difficult to be certain at what

297
00:10:32,302 --> 00:10:34,510
levels assassination activity was known

298
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:35,367
and authorized.

299
00:10:35,837 --> 00:10:38,145
It was also possible, the committee added,

300
00:10:38,165 --> 00:10:40,472
that there had been a successful plausible

301
00:10:40,492 --> 00:10:42,744
denial, in which authorization was issued

302
00:10:42,764 --> 00:10:43,852
but is now obscured.

303
00:10:44,772 --> 00:10:46,770
The paper trail came out in stages.

304
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:50,466
The Senate report in November 1975.

305
00:10:50,936 --> 00:10:53,551
In 1997, the State Department's official

306
00:10:53,571 --> 00:10:56,055
history volume on Cuba, with Kennedy's

307
00:10:56,075 --> 00:10:58,624
order, Lansdale's plans and the meeting

308
00:10:58,644 --> 00:10:59,019
notes.

309
00:10:59,489 --> 00:11:01,843
And more records from the National

310
00:11:01,863 --> 00:11:04,775
Archives' Kennedy assassination collection

311
00:11:04,795 --> 00:11:05,962
in 2017 and 2025.

312
00:11:06,533 --> 00:11:08,382
So what was Operation Mongoose?

313
00:11:08,852 --> 00:11:11,127
A secret program, ordered in writing by

314
00:11:11,147 --> 00:11:13,481
the President and driven by his brother,

315
00:11:13,501 --> 00:11:15,717
to bring down Castro's government from

316
00:11:15,737 --> 00:11:16,424
