317
00:11:16,993 --> 00:11:19,219
Its own planners said success would need

318
00:11:19,239 --> 00:11:20,117
American troops.

319
00:11:20,699 --> 00:11:23,641
Its target date was October 1962.

320
00:11:24,224 --> 00:11:26,577
And that October, instead of a revolt, the

321
00:11:26,597 --> 00:11:28,553
world got the Cuban Missile Crisis.

322
00:11:29,123 --> 00:11:30,993
Every secret has a release date.

323
00:11:31,576 --> 00:11:33,792
For Mongoose, the first one came thirteen

324
00:11:33,812 --> 00:11:35,537
years later, in a Senate report.

325
